>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MUL-GIVING.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-B PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-C PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-D PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    DISPLAY "MUL GIVING DEMO STARTED".
    MOVE 10 TO WS-A.
    MOVE 25 TO WS-B.
    DISPLAY "INITIAL A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B.
    MULTIPLY WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-C.
    DISPLAY "MUL A BY B GIVING C: A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B " C=" WS-C.
    MULTIPLY 4 BY WS-B.
    DISPLAY "MUL 4 BY B INPLACE: A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B " C=" WS-C.
    MULTIPLY WS-A BY WS-B GIVING WS-D.
    DISPLAY "MUL A BY B GIVING D: A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B " D=" WS-D.
    DISPLAY "MUL GIVING DEMO COMPLETED".
    STOP RUN.
